<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average rose 71.77 points to 8,259.31, a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite index rose 4.04 to 497.00, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share added 37 cents.</p>
<p>Advancing issues beat decliners 1,836 to 976.</p>
<p>Volume was 565,170,540 compared with 525,661,800 on Tuesday.</p>
